# Foresi

> Foresi is an open-source business system for small firms: invoices, contacts, payments and work. This installation is at {{ home }}. AI agents use it through its MCP server, signed in with OAuth or a personal API token.

## MCP

- [Install the Foresi MCP server]({{ setup }}): step-by-step setup for Claude Code, claude.ai, Claude Desktop, Cursor and VS Code
- [MCP server]({{ server }}): Streamable HTTP, OAuth 2.1 sign-in (recommended) or the header `Authorization: Bearer <token>`
- [API tokens]({{ tokens }}): where a person creates a token for a client without OAuth (sign-in required)

## Optional

- [Foresi on GitHub](https://github.com/foresi/foresi): source code and documentation (docs/mcp.md, docs/api.md)
